# TextFSM template for `show version` on Cisco Catalyst 2950 EI.
# Verified: IOS 12.1(22)EA9, WS-C2950G-48-EI.
Value HOSTNAME (\S+)
Value UPTIME (.+)
Value VERSION (\S+)
Value MODEL (\S+)
Value SERIAL (\S+)

Start
  ^.*, Version ${VERSION}, RELEASE SOFTWARE
  ^${HOSTNAME} uptime is ${UPTIME}\s*$$
  ^Model number:\s+${MODEL}\s*$$
  ^System serial number:\s+${SERIAL}\s*$$ -> Record
